# CLAUDE.md

This file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository.

## Project Overview

SimpleTrader is a Python-based algorithmic trading bot that implements a Simple Moving Average (SMA) crossover strategy. It supports two Indian broker APIs: **Nubra** (production) and **Upstox**, for fetching market data and placing orders.

The bot continuously monitors market data, generates buy/sell signals based on SMA crossovers (fast SMA crossing slow SMA), and places mock orders accordingly.

